 "_question": "team-lead asked: how many columns across all tables are named *ID but typed Text? Does the 972-edge FK graph have a systematic blind spot?",
 "_answer": "YES, and it is larger than Text alone - but the damage to the spine classification is exactly ONE object.",
 "_firm": "(ASG)BBW  train-bbw.lucernex.com",
